de vulnérabilités de sécurité dans le code","Mise en œuvre de règles de mode de contamination pour les vulnérabilités de flux de données","Application de règles de codage pour garantir les normes de codage"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Semgrep-Regeln für spezifische Fehlermuster","Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken im Code","Implementierung von Regeln für den Kontaminationsmodus zur Erkennung von Datenfluss-Sicherheitslücken","Anwendung von Codierungsregeln zur Einhaltung der Codierungsstandards"],"pt":["Criação de regras Semgrep para padrões de bugs específicos","Detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança em código","Suporte a modo de contaminação para vulnerabilidades de fluxo de dados","Implementação de padrões de codificação"],"ru":["Создание правил Semgrep для конкретных шаблонов ошибок","Обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности в коде","Поддержка режима заражения для уязвимостей потока данных","Реализация стандартов кодирования"],"ar":["إنشاء قواعد Semgrep لأنماط الأخطاء المحددة","اكتشاف الثغرات الأمنية في الكود","دعم وضع التلوث لثغرات تدفق البيانات","تنفيذ معايير الت코يد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use semgrep-rule-creator","semgrep-rule-creator setup guide","semgrep-rule-creator alternative","semgrep-rule-creator vs static analysis","creating custom Semgrep rules","semgrep-rule-creator install"],"zh":["Semgrep规则创建","安全漏洞检测","数据流漏洞检测","编码标准执行","规则测试和验证","AI工具","代码安全"],"ja":["Semgrepルール作成","セキュリティ脆弱性検出","データフローの脆弱性検出","コーディング規約の実施","ルールのテストと検証","AIエージェント","コードのセキュリティ"],"ko":["Semgrep 규칙 생성","보안 취약점 탐지","데이터 흐름 취약점 탐지","코딩 표준 강제","규칙 테스트 및 검증","AIツール","코드 보안"],"es":["creador de reglas Semgrep","herramientas de seguridad de código","detección de vulnerabilidades","reglas de codificación","modo de contaminación","análisis de código estático","IA para la seguridad del código"],"fr":["créateur de règles Semgrep","outils de sécurité de code","détection de vulnérabilités","règles de codage","mode de contamination","analyse de code statique","IA pour la sécurité du code"],"de":["Semgrep-Regel-Ersteller","Code-Sicherheitstools","Sicherheitslücken-Erkennung","Codierungsregeln","Kontaminationsmodus","Statischer Code-Analyse","KI für Code-Sicherheit"],"pt":["semgrep rule creator","criação de regras semgrep","detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança","padrões de bugs","modo de contaminação","padrões de codificação"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","semgrep rule creator","создание правил semgrep","обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности","шаблоны ошибок","режим заражения"],"ar":["أداة الإيمان الصناعي","semgrep rule creator","إنشاء قواعد semgrep","اكتشاف الثغرات الأمنية","أنماط الأخطاء","وضع التلوث"]}},"owner":"pratyushdeosingh","repo":"mdp","repoPath":"pratyushdeosingh/mdp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T06:46:51Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"semgrep-rule-creator","description":"Creates custom Semgrep rules for detecting security vulnerabilities, bug patterns, and code patterns. Use when writing Semgrep rules or building custom static analysis detections.","bodyPreview":"# Semgrep Rule Creator\n\nCreate production-quality Semgrep rules with proper testing and validation.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Ideal scenarios:**\n- Writing Semgrep rules for specific bug patterns\n- Writing rules to detect security vulnerabilities in your codebase\n- Writing taint mode rules for data flow vulnerabilities\n- Writing rules to enforce coding standards\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Running existing Semgrep rulesets\n- General static analysis without custom rules (use `static","body":"# Semgrep Rule Creator\n\nCreate production-quality Semgrep rules with proper testing and validation.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Ideal scenarios:**\n- Writing Semgrep rules for specific bug patterns\n- Writing rules to detect security vulnerabilities in your codebase\n- Writing taint mode rules for data flow vulnerabilities\n- Writing rules to enforce coding standards\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Running existing Semgrep rulesets\n- General static analysis without custom rules (use `static-analysis` skill)\n\n## Rationalizations to Reject\n\nWhen writing Semgrep rules, reject these common shortcuts:\n\n- **\"The pattern looks complete\"** → Still run `semgrep --test --config <rule-id>.yaml <rule-id>.<ext>` to verify. Untested rules have hidden false positives/negatives.\n- **\"It matches the vulnerable case\"** → Matching vulnerabilities is half the job. Verify safe cases don''t match (false positives break trust).\n- **\"Taint mode is overkill for this\"** → If data flows from user input to a dangerous sink, taint mode gives better precision than pattern matching.\n- **\"One test is enough\"** → Include edge cases: different coding styles, sanitized inputs, safe alternatives, and boundary conditions.\n- **\"I''ll optimize the patterns first\"** → Write correct patterns first, optimize after all tests pass. Premature optimization causes regressions.\n- **\"The AST dump is too complex\"** → The AST reveals exactly how Semgrep sees code. Skipping it leads to patterns that miss syntactic variations.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n**Too broad** - matches everything, useless for detection:\n```yaml\n# BAD: Matches any function call\npattern: $FUNC(...)\n\n# GOOD: Specific dangerous function\npattern: eval(...)\n```\n\n**Missing safe cases in tests** - leads to undetected false positives:\n```python\n# BAD: Only tests vulnerable case\n# ruleid: my-rule\ndangerous(user_input)\n\n# GOOD: Include safe cases to verify no false positives\n# ruleid: my-rule\ndangerous(user_input)\n\n# ok: my-rule\ndangerous(sanitize(user_input))\n\n# ok: my-rule\ndangerous(\"hardcoded_safe_value\")\n```\n\n**Overly specific patterns** - misses variations:\n```yaml\n# BAD: Only matches exact format\npattern: os.system(\"rm \" + $VAR)\n\n# GOOD: Matches all os.system calls with taint tracking\nmode: taint\npattern-sinks:\n  - pattern: os.system(...)\n```\n\n## Strictness Level\n\nThis workflow is **strict** - do not skip steps:\n- **Read documentation first**: See [Documentation](#documentation) before writing Semgrep rules\n- **Test-first is mandatory**: Never write a rule without tests\n- **100% test pass is required**: \"Most tests pass\" is not acceptable\n- **Optimization comes last**: Only simplify patterns after all tests pass\n- **Avoid generic patterns**: Rules must be specific, not match broad patterns\n- **Prioritize taint mode**: For data flow vulnerabilities\n- **One YAML file - one Semgrep rule**: Each YAML file must contain only one Semgrep rule; don''t combine multiple rules in a single file\n- **No generic rules**: When targeting a specific language for Semgrep rules - avoid generic pattern matching (`languages: generic`)\n- **Forbidden `todook` and `todoruleid` test annotations**: `todoruleid: <rule-id>` and `todook: <rule-id>` annotations in tests files for future rule improvements are forbidden\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides creation of Semgrep rules that detect security vulnerabilities and code patterns. Rules are created iteratively: analyze the problem, write tests first, analyze AST structure, write the rule, iterate until all tests pass, optimize the rule.\n\n**Approach selection:**\n- **Taint mode** (prioritize): Data flow issues where untrusted input reaches dangerous sinks\n- **Pattern matching**: Simple syntactic patterns without data flow requirements\n\n**Why prioritize taint mode?** Pattern matching finds syntax but misses context. A pattern `eval($X)` matches both `eval(user_input)` (vulnerable) and `eval(\"safe_literal\")` (safe). Taint mode tracks data flow, so it only alerts when untrusted data actually reaches the sink—dramatically reducing false positives for injection vulnerabilities.\n\n**Iterating between approaches:** It''s okay to experiment. If you start with taint mode and it''s not working well (e.g., taint doesn''t propagate as expected, too many false positives/negatives), switch to pattern matching. Conversely, if pattern matching produces too many false positives on safe cases, try taint mode instead. The goal is a working rule—not rigid adherence to one approach.\n\n**Output structure** - exactly 2 files in a directory named after the rule-id:\n```\n<rule-id>/\n├── <rule-id>.yaml     # Semgrep rule\n└── <rule-id>.<ext>    # Test file with ruleid/ok annotations\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```yaml\nrules:\n  - id: insecure-eval\n    languages: [python]\n    severity: HIGH\n    message: User input passed to eval() allows code execution\n    mode: taint\n    pattern-sources:\n      - pattern: request.args.get(...)\n    pattern-sinks:\n      - pattern: eval(...)\n```\n\nTest file (`insecure-eval.py`):\n```python\n# ruleid: insecure-eval\neval(request.args.get(''code''))\n\n# ok: insecure-eval\neval(\"print(''safe'')\")\n```\n\nRun tests (from rule directory): `semgrep --test --config <rule-id>.yaml <rule-id>.<ext>`\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- For commands, pattern operators, and taint mode syntax, see quick-reference.md.\n- For detailed workflow and examples, you MUST see workflow.md\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nSemgrep Rule Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Analyze the Problem\n- [ ] Step 2: Write Tests First\n- [ ] Step 3: Analyze AST structure\n- [ ] Step 4: Write the rule\n- [ ] Step 5: Iterate until all tests pass (semgrep --test)\n- [ ] Step 6: Optimize the rule (remove redundancies, re-test)\n- [ ] Step 7: Final Run\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n**REQUIRED**: Before writing any rule, use WebFetch to read **all** of these 4 links with Semgrep documentation:\n\n1. [Rule Syntax](https://semgrep.dev/docs/writing-rules/rule-syntax)\n2. [Pattern Syntax](https://semgrep.dev/docs/writing-rules/pattern-syntax)\n3. [ToB Testing Handbook - Semgrep](https://appsec.guide/docs/static-analysis/semgrep/advanced/)\n4. [Constant propagation](https://semgrep.dev/docs/writing-rules/data-flow/constant-propagation)\n5. [Writing Rules Index](https://github.com/semgrep/semgrep-docs/tree/main/docs/writing-rules/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:14:57.969Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Security Agents needing custom Semgrep rule creation for bug patterns and security vulnerabilities.","zh":"适用于需要创建自定义 Semgrep 规则以检测 bug 模式和安全漏洞的代码安全代理。","ja":"コードセキュリティエージェントがバグパターンとセキュリティ脆弱性のためのカスタムSemgrepルールを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 보안 에이전트가 버그 패턴 및 보안 취약성을 위한 사용자 지정 Semgrep 규칙을 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad de Código que necesitan creación de reglas personalizadas de Semgrep para patrones de errores y vulnerabilidades de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité de Code ayant besoin de création de règles Semgrep personnalisées pour les modèles de bogues et les vulnérabilités de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Sicherheitsagenten, die eine benutzerdefinierte Erstellung von Semgrep-Regeln für Fehlermuster und Sicherheitslücken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança de Código que precisam de criação personalizada de regras Semgrep para padrões de bugs e vulnerabilidades de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности кода, которым требуется создание пользовательских правил Semgrep для шаблонов ошибок и уязвимостей безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أمن الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء قواعد Semgrep مخصصة لأنماط العيوب والثغرات الأمنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write production-quality Semgrep rules with proper testing and validation, enabling detection of specific bug patterns, security vulnerabilities, and enforcement of coding standards using taint mode rules for data flow vulnerabilities.","zh":"赋予代理编写生产质量的 Semgrep 规则的能力，具有适当的测试和验证，实现特定 bug 模式、安全漏洞的检测以及使用污点模式规则对数据流漏洞进行编码标准的强制执行。","ja":"エージェントがプロダクション品質のSemgrepルールを適切なテストと検証で書くことを可能にし、特定のバグパターン、セキュリティ脆弱性の検出、およびデータフローの脆弱性に対する汚染モードルールを使用したコード規範の適用を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 프로덕션 품질의 Semgrep 규칙을 적절한 테스트 및 검증으로 작성할 수 있도록 하여 특정 버그 패턴, 보안 취약성의检测 및 데이터 흐름 취약성에 대한 테인팅 모드 규칙을 사용한 코딩 표준 적용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir reglas Semgrep de calidad de producción con pruebas y validación adecuadas, lo que permite la detección de patrones de errores específicos, vulnerabilidades de seguridad y el cumplimiento de normas de codificación utilizando reglas de modo de tainting para vulnerabilidades de flujo de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des règles Semgrep de qualité de production avec des tests et une validation appropriés, permettant la détection de modèles de bogues spécifiques, de vulnérabilités de sécurité et l''application de normes de codage en utilisant des règles de mode de taint pour les vulnérabilités de flux de données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Semgrep-Regeln mit Produktionsqualität zu schreiben, mit ordnungsgemäßer Testung und Validierung, wodurch die Erkennung spezifischer Fehlermuster, Sicherheitslücken und die Einhaltung von Codierungsstandards mithilfe von Taint-Modus-Regeln für Datenfluss-Schwachstellen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever regras Semgrep de produção com testes e validação adequados, permitindo a detecção de padrões de bugs específicos, vulnerabilidades de segurança e aplicação de padrões de codificação usando regras de modo de contaminação para vulnerabilidades de fluxo de dados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать правила Semgrep производственного качества с надлежащим тестированием и проверкой, что обеспечивает обнаружение конкретных шаблонов ошибок, уязвимостей безопасности и соблюдение стандартов кодирования с помощью правил режима заражения для уязвимостей потока данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية كتابة قواعد Semgrep من الدرجة الأولى مع الاختبارات والتحقق المناسبين، مما يسمح بالكشف عن أنماط أخطاء محددة وثغرات أمنية وتنفيذ معايير البرمجة باستخدام قواعد режим التلوث للكشف عن ثغرات تدفق البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing custom Semgrep rules for specific bug patterns","Detecting security vulnerabilities in codebases using Semgrep rules","Enforcing coding standards with custom Semgrep rules","Creating taint mode rules for data flow vulnerability detection"],"zh":["编写特定 bug 模式的自定义 Semgrep 规则","使用 Semgrep 规则检测代码库中的安全漏洞","使用自定义 Semgrep 规则强制执行编码标准","创建污点模式规则以检测数据流漏洞"],"ja":["特定バグパターンのためのカスタムSemgrepルールの作成","Semgrepルールを使用したコードベースのセキュリティ脆弱性の検出","カスタムSemgrepルールを使用したコード規範の適用","データフローの脆弱性の検出のための汚染モードルールの作成"],"ko":["특정 버그 패턴을 위한 사용자 지정 Semgrep 규칙 작성","Semgrep 규칙을 사용한 코드베이스의 보안 취약성 탐지","사용자 지정 Semgrep 규칙을 사용한 코딩 표준 적용","데이터 흐름 취약성 탐지를 위한 테인팅 모드 규칙 생성"],"es":["Escritura de reglas Semgrep personalizadas para patrones de errores específicos","Detección de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en bases de código mediante reglas Semgrep","Aplicación de normas de codificación con reglas Semgrep personalizadas","Creación de reglas de modo de tainting para la detección de vulnerabilidades de flujo de datos"],"fr":["Écriture de règles Semgrep personnalisées pour les modèles de bogues spécifiques","Détection de vulnérabilités de sécurité dans les bases de code à l''aide de règles Semgrep","Application de normes de codage avec des règles Semgrep personnalisées","Création de règles de mode de taint pour la détection de vulnérabilités de flux de données"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Semgrep-Regeln für spezifische Fehlermuster","Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken in Codebasen mithilfe von Semgrep-Regeln","Durchsetzung von Codierungsstandards mit benutzerdefinierten Semgrep-Regeln","Erstellung von Taint-Modus-Regeln für die Erkennung von Datenfluss-Schwachstellen"],"pt":["Escrita de regras Semgrep personalizadas para padrões de bugs específicos","Detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança em bases de código usando regras Semgrep","Aplicação de padrões de codificação com regras Semgrep personalizadas","Criação de regras de modo de contaminação para detecção de vulnerabilidades de fluxo de dados"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских правил Semgrep для конкретных шаблонов ошибок","Обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности в кодовых базах с помощью правил Semgrep","Применение стандартов кодирования с помощью пользовательских правил Semgrep","Создание правил режима заражения для обнаружения уязвимостей потока данных"],"ar":["كتابة قواعد Semgrep المخصصة لأنماط أخطاء محددة","الكشف عن ثغرات أمنية في قواعد البيانات باستخدام قواعد Semgrep","تنفيذ معايير البرمجة مع قواعد Semgrep المخصصة","إنشاء قواعد وضع التلوث للكشف عن ثغرات تدفق البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for running existing Semgrep rulesets","Not intended for general static analysis without custom rules"],"zh":["不适合运行现有的 Semgrep 规则集","不用于没有自定义规则的普通静态分析"],"ja":["既存のSemgrepルールセットを実行するには適していない","カスタムルールなしの一般的な静的解析には使用しない"],"ko":["기존 Semgrep 규칙 세트를 실행하는 데 적합하지 않음","사용자 지정 규칙이 없는 일반적인 정적 분석에는 사용하지 않음"],"es":["No adecuado para ejecutar conjuntos de reglas Semgrep existentes","No destinado a análisis estático general sin reglas personalizadas"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté pour exécuter les ensembles de règles Semgrep existants","N''est pas destiné à l''analyse statique générale sans règles personnalisées"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für die Ausführung bestehender Semgrep-Regelsätze","Nicht für allgemeine statische Analyse ohne benutzerdefinierte Regeln vorgesehen"],"pt":["Não é adequado para executar conjuntos de regras Semgrep existentes","Não é destinado à análise estática geral sem regras personalizadas"],"ru":["Не подходит для запуска существующих наборов правил Semgrep","Не предназначен для общего статического анализа без пользовательских правил"],"ar":["غير مناسب لتشغيل مجموعات قواعد Semgrep الحالية","غير مقصود للتحليل الساكن العام بدون قواعد مخصصة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9006fc329992b066dd10f0c90390fb95f42268fa735eabb0042d6cb2d3473ef7","qualityScore":54}');
