 ist ein KI-Tool, das die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen über die Jira-API oder MCP ermöglicht","pt":"O que é jira-issues? É uma habilidade de IA que permite criar e gerenciar problemas do Jira","ru":"Что такое jira-issues? Это навык ИИ, который позволяет создавать и управлять проблемами Jira","ar":"ما هي مهارة jira-issues؟ هي مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تتيح إنشاء وإدارة قضايا جيرا"},"features":{"en":["Installs Jira MCP server using npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira command","Sets environment variables for Jira REST API integration, including JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, and JIRA_API_TOKEN","Supports direct API setup with API token management","Utilizes bash commands for setup and configuration","Integrates with Jira REST API for seamless issue management","Manages Jira issues using MCP server for AI agents"],"zh":["使用 Jira REST API 创建和管理 Jira 问题","使用 MCP 实现 Jira 问题管理","支持环境变量设置","支持 API 令牌获取","提供 Jira 问题管理的便捷方式","支持 CLI 命令"],"ja":["Jira REST API を使用して Jira の課題を创建および管理する","MCP を使用して Jira の課題を管理する","環境変数の設定をサポート","API トークンの取得をサポート","Jira の課題管理の便捷な方法を提供","CLI コマンドをサポート"],"ko":["Jira REST API를 사용하여 Jira 이슈를 생성하고 관리합니다","MCP를 사용하여 Jira 이슈를 관리합니다","환경 변수 설정을 지원합니다","API 토큰 获取을 지원합니다","Jira 이슈 관리의 편리한 방법을 제공합니다","CLI 명령어를 지원합니다"],"es":["Integración con la API de Jira","Soporte para MCP","Creación y gestión de problemas de Jira","Uso de npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira para una integración sin problemas","Configuración de variables de entorno para la API de Jira"],"fr":["Intégration à l''API Jira","Prise en charge de MCP","Création et gestion des problèmes Jira","Utilisation de npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira pour une intégration sans problème","Configuration des variables d''environnement pour l''API Jira"],"de":["Integration in die Jira-API","Unterstützung für MCP","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen","Verwendung von npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira für eine reibungslose Integration","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen für die Jira-API"],"pt":["Crie e gerencie problemas do Jira com o Jira REST API","Integre com o servidor MCP do Jira para uma configuração fácil","Defina variáveis de ambiente para autenticação","Obtenha um token de API do Jira para autenticação","Use o CLI para executar comandos do Jira","Suporte à instalação do servidor MCP do Jira com npm"],"ru":["Создавайте и управляйте проблемами Jira с помощью Jira REST API","Интегрируйте с сервером MCP Jira для легкой настройки","Определите переменные среды для аутентификации","Получите токен API Jira для аутентификации","Используйте CLI для выполнения команд Jira","Поддержка установки сервера MCP Jira с помощью npm"],"ar":["أنشئ وادِر قضايا جيرا باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا","اضمن التكامل مع خادم MCP من جيرا لتكوين سهل","عرف متغيرات البيئة للتحقق","احصل على رمز وصول واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا للتحقق","استخدم واجهة سطر الأوامر للتشغيل أوامر جيرا","دعم تثبيت خادم MCP من جيرا باستخدام npm"]},"keywords":{"en":["jira-issues setup guide","jira rest api integration","jira mcp server install","how to use jira-issues with ai agents","jira-issues alternative","jira-issues vs trello","jira api token management","jira issue management for ai agents","npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira"],"zh":["Jira 问题管理","Jira REST API","MCP","环境变量设置","API 令牌获取","CLI 命令","Jira 问题创建","Jira 问题管理工具","AI 에이전트"],"ja":["Jira Issue 管理","Jira REST API","MCP","環境変数設定","API トークンの取得","CLI コマンド","Jira の課題创建","Jira の課題管理ツール","AI エージェント"],"ko":["Jira 이슈 관리","Jira REST API","MCP","환경 변수 설정","API 토큰 获取","CLI 명령어","Jira 이슈 생성","Jira 이슈 관리 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Jira Issues","agentes de IA","API de Jira","MCP","npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira","configuración de variables de entorno","creación de problemas de Jira","gestión de problemas de Jira"],"fr":["problèmes Jira","outils d''IA","API Jira","MCP","npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira","configuration des variables d''environnement","création de problèmes Jira","gestion de problèmes Jira"],"de":["Jira-Probleme","KI-Agents","Jira-API","MCP","npx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen"],"pt":["jira issues","ferramentas de ia","jira rest api","mcp jira","autenticação jira","token de api jira","cli jira","instalação do servidor mcp jira"],"ru":["jira issues","ии агенты","jira rest api","mcp jira","аутентификация jira","токен api jira","cli jira","установка сервера mcp jira"],"ar":["قضايا جيرا","عمليات إيجار ذكية","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا","خادم م سي بي جيرا","التحقق من جيرا","رمز وصول واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا","واجهة سطر الأوامر جيرا","تثبيت خادم م سي بي جيرا"]}},"owner":"skillcreatorai","repo":"Ai-Agent-Skills","repoPath":"skillcreatorai/Ai-Agent-Skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-issues","description":"Create, update, and manage Jira issues from natural language. Use when the user wants to log bugs, create tickets, update issue status, or manage their Jira backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/sec","body":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens\n\n## Creating Issues\n\n### Basic Issue\n```python\nimport requests\nfrom requests.auth import HTTPBasicAuth\nimport os\n\ndef create_issue(project_key, summary, description, issue_type=\"Task\"):\n    url = f\"{os.environ[''JIRA_BASE_URL'']}/rest/api/3/issue\"\n\n    auth = HTTPBasicAuth(\n        os.environ[''JIRA_EMAIL''],\n        os.environ[''JIRA_API_TOKEN'']\n    )\n\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type}\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()\n\n# Example\nissue = create_issue(\"PROJ\", \"Fix login bug\", \"Users can''t login with SSO\", \"Bug\")\nprint(f\"Created: {issue[''key'']}\")\n```\n\n### With Labels and Priority\n```python\ndef create_detailed_issue(project_key, summary, description,\n                          issue_type=\"Task\", priority=\"Medium\",\n                          labels=None, assignee=None):\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type},\n            \"priority\": {\"name\": priority},\n        }\n    }\n\n    if labels:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"labels\"] = labels\n    if assignee:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"assignee\"] = {\"accountId\": assignee}\n\n    # ... make request\n```\n\n## Common Issue Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| Bug | Something broken |\n| Task | Work item |\n| Story | User-facing feature |\n| Epic | Large initiative |\n| Sub-task | Part of larger task |\n\n## Updating Issues\n\n### Change Status\n```python\ndef transition_issue(issue_key, transition_name):\n    # Get available transitions\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/transitions\"\n    transitions = requests.get(url, auth=auth).json()\n\n    # Find matching transition\n    transition_id = None\n    for t in transitions[''transitions'']:\n        if t[''name''].lower() == transition_name.lower():\n            transition_id = t[''id'']\n            break\n\n    # Execute transition\n    requests.post(url, json={\"transition\": {\"id\": transition_id}}, auth=auth)\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n```python\ndef add_comment(issue_key, comment_text):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/comment\"\n\n    payload = {\n        \"body\": {\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\n            \"version\": 1,\n            \"content\": [{\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": comment_text}]\n            }]\n        }\n    }\n\n    requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n```\n\n## Searching Issues\n\n### JQL Queries\n```python\ndef search_issues(jql):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/search\"\n    params = {\"jql\": jql, \"maxResults\": 50}\n    response = requests.get(url, params=params, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()[''issues'']\n\n# Examples\nmy_bugs = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND type = Bug AND assignee = currentUser()\")\nopen_items = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND status != Done\")\nrecent = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND created >= -7d\")\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\nWhen user says... create this:\n\n| Command | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"log bug about X\" | Bug issue with description |\n| \"create task for X\" | Task issue |\n| \"what''s on my plate\" | JQL: assignee = currentUser() AND status != Done |\n| \"move X to done\" | Transition issue to Done |\n| \"add comment to X\" | Add comment to issue |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Summary**: Keep under 80 chars, start with verb (Fix, Add, Update)\n2. **Description**: Include steps to reproduce for bugs\n3. **Labels**: Use for categorization (frontend, backend, urgent)\n4. **Links**: Reference related issues when relevant\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:33.515Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents requiring seamless Jira issue integration and automation.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成Jira问题和自动化的项目管理代理。","ja":"Jiraの課題を無缝に統合し、自動化する必要があるプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"Jira 이슈 통합 및 자동화가 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que requieren una integración y automatización perfectas de problemas de Jira.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une intégration et une automatisation sans faille des problèmes Jira.","de":"Ideal für Project-Management-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration und Automatisierung von Jira-Problemen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que exigem integração perfeita de problemas do Jira e automação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по управлению проектами, требующих бесперебойной интеграции проблем Jira и автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تتطلب تكاملًا سلسًا لتحديد مشاكل Jira وتوضيحها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP, streamlining project workflows and enhancing collaboration through environment variables like JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, and JIRA_API_TOKEN.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Jira问题的能力，使用Jira REST API或MCP，简化项目工作流程，并通过环境变量如JIRA_BASE_URL、JIRA_EMAIL和JIRA_API_TOKEN增强协作。","ja":"Jira REST APIまたはMCPを使用してJiraの課題を作成および管理するエージェントを可能にし、プロジェクトのワークフローを合理化し、JIRA_BASE_URL、JIRA_EMAIL、JIRA_API_TOKENなどの環境変数を介してコラボレーションを強化します。","ko":"Jira REST API 또는 MCP를 사용하여 Jira 이슈를 생성 및 관리하는 에이전트를 가능하게 해줌으로써 프로젝트 워크플로우를 간소화하고 JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, JIRA_API_TOKEN 등의 환경 변수를 통해 협력을增强합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y gestionar problemas de Jira utilizando la API de REST de Jira o MCP, simplificando los flujos de trabajo del proyecto y mejorando la colaboración a través de variables de entorno como JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL y JIRA_API_TOKEN.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira en utilisant l''API REST Jira ou MCP, rationalisant les flux de travail de projet et améliorant la collaboration via des variables d''environnement comme JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL et JIRA_API_TOKEN.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Jira-Probleme mithilfe der Jira-REST-API oder MCP zu erstellen und zu verwalten, wodurch die Projekt-Workflows rationalisiert und die Zusammenarbeit durch Umgebungsvariablen wie JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL und JIRA_API_TOKEN verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar problemas do Jira usando a Jira REST API ou MCP, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho do projeto e melhorando a colaboração por meio de variáveis de ambiente como JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL e JIRA_API_TOKEN.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять проблемами Jira с помощью Jira REST API или MCP, оптимизируя рабочие процессы проекта и улучшая сотрудничество посредством переменных среды, таких как JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL и JIRA_API_TOKEN.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء مشاكل Jira وإدارتها باستخدام Jira REST API أو MCP، من خلال تسهيل تدفقات العمل للمشروع وتعزيز التعاون من خلال متغيرات البيئة مثل JIRA_BASE_URL و JIRA_EMAIL و JIRA_API_TOKEN."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira issue creation for new project tasks","Managing issue assignments and priority levels using the Jira REST API","Debugging Jira integration issues through MCP server logs"],"zh":["自动创建新的项目任务的Jira问题","使用Jira REST API管理问题的分配和优先级","通过MCP服务器日志调试Jira集成问题"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトタスクのJiraの課題を自動作成","Jira REST APIを使用して課題の割り当てと優先順位を管理","MCPサーバーログを使用してJira統合の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트 태스크를 위한 Jira 이슈 자동 생성","Jira REST API를 사용하여 이슈 할당 및 우선순위를 관리","MCP 서버 로그를 통해 Jira 통합 이슈 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Jira para nuevas tareas de proyecto","Gestión de asignaciones de problemas y niveles de prioridad utilizando la API de REST de Jira","Depuración de problemas de integración de Jira a través de registros del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Jira pour les nouvelles tâches de projet","Gestion des affectations de problèmes et des niveaux de priorité en utilisant l''API REST Jira","Débogage des problèmes d''intégration Jira via les journaux du serveur MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Jira-Problemen für neue Projekt-Tasks","Verwaltung von Problemaufgaben und Prioritätsstufen unter Verwendung der Jira-REST-API","Fehlerbehebung von Jira-Integrationsschwierigkeiten über MCP-Server-Logs"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do Jira para novas tarefas de projeto","Gerenciar atribuições de problemas e níveis de prioridade usando a Jira REST API","Depurar problemas de integração do Jira por meio de logs do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем Jira для новых задач проекта","Управлять назначениями проблем и уровнями приоритета с помощью Jira REST API","Отлаживать проблемы интеграции Jira посредством журналов сервера MCP"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء مشاكل Jira لأهداف المشروع الجديدة","إدارة مهام وتحديد الأولويات لمشاكل Jira باستخدام Jira REST API","تصحيح مشاكل التكامل في Jira من خلال سجلات خادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira API token or MCP server setup","Dependent on Jira REST API or MCP compatibility"],"zh":["需要Jira API令牌或MCP服务器设置","依赖于Jira REST API或MCP的兼容性"],"ja":["Jira APIトークンまたはMCPサーバーの設定が必要","Jira REST APIまたはMCPの互換性に依存"],"ko":["Jira API 토큰 또는 MCP 서버 설정이 필요","Jira REST API 또는 MCP의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere token de API de Jira o configuración del servidor MCP","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la API de REST de Jira o MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API Jira ou une configuration du serveur MCP","Dépend de la compatibilité de l''API REST Jira ou MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-API-Token oder MCP-Server-Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der Jira-REST-API oder MCP"],"pt":["Exige token de API do Jira ou configuração do servidor MCP","Dependente da compatibilidade da Jira REST API ou MCP"],"ru":["Требует токена API Jira или настройки сервера MCP","Зависит от совместимости Jira REST API или MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول API Jira أو إعداد خادم MCP","يعتمد على توافق Jira REST API أو MCP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"649a1012fe6ddb0e7e86e83e267dd23b27dad0ac22195311205d5d4e7b0632fc","qualityScore":54}');
