l que incluye componentes preconstruidos para conversaciones y mensajes","fr":"AI Elements est un ensemble d''outils d''intelligence artificielle qui comprend des composants préconstruits pour les conversations et les messages","de":"AI Elements ist ein Satz von KI-Tools, der vorgefertigte Komponenten für Konversationen und Nachrichten enthält","pt":"O que é ai-elements? É uma biblioteca de componentes para construir aplicativos com inteligência artificial","ru":"Что такое ai-elements? Это библиотека компонентов для создания приложений с искусственным интеллектом","ar":"ما هو ai-elements؟ هو مكتبة مكونات لبناء أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Provides pre-built components like conversations and messages","Built on top of shadcn/ui for seamless integration","Supports installation via dedicated CLI command","Integrates with standard shadcn/ui CLI for existing users","Offers a custom registry for extended functionality","Includes components for building AI-native applications faster"],"zh":["预建组件，如会话和消息","基于shadcn/ui的组件库","自定义注册表","快速集成CLI命令","与shadcn/ui CLI兼容"],"ja":["事前構築コンポーネント，如会話とメッセージ","shadcn/uiのコンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","迅速なセットアップCLIコマンド","shadcn/ui CLIとの互換性"],"ko":["사전 구축 컴포넌트, 대화 및 메시지","shadcn/ui 기반 컴포넌트 라이브러리","사용자 정의 레지스트리","빠른 설정 CLI 명령","shadcn/ui CLI와의 호환성"],"es":["Componentes preconstruidos para conversaciones y mensajes","Integración con shadcn/ui","Registro personalizado para una mayor flexibilidad","Instalación rápida mediante CLI","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Composants préconstruits pour les conversations et les messages","Intégration avec shadcn/ui","Registre personnalisé pour une plus grande flexibilité","Installation rapide via CLI","Compatibilité avec les applications d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Vorgefertigte Komponenten für Konversationen und Nachrichten","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Benutzerdefinierter Registry für eine größere Flexibilität","Schnelle Installation über CLI","Kompatibilität mit KI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Biblioteca de componentes pré-construídos para conversas e mensagens","Integração com shadcn/ui","Registro personalizado para componentes","Instalação rápida via CLI","Suporte a aplicativos nativos de IA"],"ru":["Библиотека предварительно построенных компонентов для разговоров и сообщений","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Пользовательский реестр для компонентов","Быстрая установка через CLI","Поддержка приложений с искусственным интеллектом"],"ar":["مكتبة مكونات مُسبقة البناء لالمحادثات والرسائل","التكامل مع shadcn/ui","سجل مخصص للمكونات","التثبيت السريع عبر CLI","دعم تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ai-elements","ai-elements setup guide","ai-elements vs shadcn/ui","ai-elements install","what is ai-elements","ai-elements alternative","ai-elements custom registry","building AI-native applications with ai-elements","ai-elements component library"],"zh":["ai-elements","shadcn/ui","AI本地应用","组件库","自定义注册表","快速集成","CLI命令","前端开发","AI开发"],"ja":["ai-elements","shadcn/ui","AIエージェント","コンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","迅速なセットアップ","CLIコマンド","フロントエンド開発","AI開発"],"ko":["ai-elements","shadcn/ui","AI 요소","컴포넌트 라이브러리","사용자 정의 레지스트리","빠른 설정","CLI 명령","프론트엔드 개발","AI 개발"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA","componentes preconstruidos","shadcn/ui","registro personalizado","instalación rápida","CLI","aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial","AI Agents","Herramientas de IA"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''applications d''IA","composants préconstruits","shadcn/ui","registre personnalisé","installation rapide","CLI","applications d''intelligence artificielle","Agents d''IA","Outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","vorgefertigte Komponenten","shadcn/ui","benutzerdefinierter Registry","schnelle Installation","CLI","KI-Anwendungen","KI-Agents","KI-Tools"],"pt":["ai-elements","aplicativos de inteligência artificial","shadcn/ui","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","CLI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","IA","aplicativos nativos de IA"],"ru":["ai-elements","ИИ Агенты","приложения с искусственным интеллектом","shadcn/ui","библиотека компонентов","пользовательский реестр","CLI","разработка приложений","ИИ","приложения с искусственным интеллектом"],"ar":["ai-elements","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي","shadcn/ui","مكتبة مكونات","سجل مخصص","CLI","تطوير تطبيقات","ذكاء اصطناعي","تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"vercel","repo":"ai-elements","repoPath":"vercel/ai-elements","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.277Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Build AI chat interfaces using ai-elements components — conversations, messages, tool displays, prompt inputs, and more. Use when the user wants to build a chatbot, AI assistant UI, or any AI-powered chat interface.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n> **IMPORTANT:** Run all CLI commands using the project''s package runner: `npx ai-elements@latest`, `pnpm dlx ai-elements@latest`, or `bunx --bun ai-elements@latest` — based on the project''s `packageManager`. Examples below use `npx ai-elements@latest` but substitute the correct runner for the project.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n### I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n### Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly.\n\n### The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n### Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:19.794Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accelerated development of AI-native applications with pre-built UI components","zh":"非常适合需要加速开发 AI 本地应用程序的前端代理，具有预建 UI 组件","ja":"フロントエンド エージェントが AI ネイティブ アプリケーションを高速に開発する必要がある場合に最適で、事前に構築された UI コンポーネントを備えています","ko":"프런트엔드 에이전트가 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 가속화하여 개발할 때 적합하며, 미리 구축된 UI 구성 요소를 보유하고 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo acelerado de aplicaciones nativas de IA con componentes de IU preconstruidos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un développement accéléré d''applications natives IA avec des composants d''interface utilisateur préconstruits","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein beschleunigtes Entwicklung von AI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desenvolvimento acelerado de aplicações nativas de IA com componentes de UI pré-construídos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим ускоренный разработка приложений, родных для ИИ, с предварительно построенными компонентами UI","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير متسارع لتطبيقات ذكية الأصل مع مكونات UI مبنية مسبقًا"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-native applications faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging the shadcn/ui library and custom registry, and integrating via standard CLI commands or dedicated AI Elements CLI","zh":"赋予代理构建 AI 本地应用程序的能力，使用预建组件（如会话和消息）并利用 shadcn/ui 库和自定义注册表，并通过标准 CLI 命令或专用 AI Elements CLI 进行集成","ja":"エージェントが事前に構築されたコンポーネント（会話やメッセージなど）を使用して AI ネイティブ アプリケーションを迅速に構築できるようにし、shadcn/ui ライブラリやカスタム レジストリを活用し、標準の CLI コマンドまたは専用の AI Elements CLI を介して統合します","ko":"에이전트가 미리 구축된 구성 요소(대화 및 메시지 등)를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 빠르게 구축할 수 있도록 하며, shadcn/ui 라이브러리 및 사용자 지정 레지스트리를 활용하고, 표준 CLI 명령 또는 전용 AI Elements CLI를 통해 통합합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones nativas de IA más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando la biblioteca shadcn/ui y el registro personalizado, e integrando a través de comandos CLI estándar o la línea de comandos dedicada de AI Elements","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications natives IA plus rapidement avec des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant la bibliothèque shadcn/ui et le registre personnalisé, et en intégrant via des commandes CLI standard ou la ligne de commande dédiée d''AI Elements","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, AI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten schneller zu erstellen, indem sie die shadcn/ui-Bibliothek und das benutzerdefinierte Register nutzen und über Standard-CLI-Befehle oder die dedizierte AI-Elemente-CLI integrieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações nativas de IA mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando a biblioteca shadcn/ui e registro personalizado, e integrando via comandos CLI padrão ou CLI dedicada de Elementos de IA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения, родные для ИИ, быстрее с помощью предварительно построенных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя библиотеку shadcn/ui и пользовательский реестр, и интегрируя через стандартные команды CLI или посвященную CLI Элементов ИИ","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات ذكية الأصل بشكل أسرع مع المكونات المبنية مسبقًا مثل المحادثات والرسائل، وتكييف المكتبة shadcn/ui والسجل المخصص، وتكامل عبر أوامر CLI القياسية أو CLI مخصصة للعناصر الذكية"},"useCases":{"en":["Building conversational interfaces with pre-built conversation components","Streamlining message UI development with customizable message components","Accelerating AI-native application development with AI Elements'' component library"],"zh":["使用预建会话组件构建对话式接口","使用可定制的消息组件简化消息 UI 开发","使用 AI Elements 的组件库加速 AI 本地应用程序开发"],"ja":["事前に構築された会話コンポーネントを使用して対話式インターフェイスを構築する","カスタマイズ可能なメッセージ コンポーネントを使用してメッセージ UI 開発を簡素化する","AI Elements のコンポーネント ライブラリを使用して AI ネイティブ アプリケーションの開発を加速する"],"ko":["미리 구축된 대화 구성 요소를 사용하여 대화식 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","사용자 지정 가능한 메시지 구성 요소를 사용하여 메시지 UI 개발을 간소화하는 것","AI Elements의 구성 요소 라이브러리를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 가속화하는 것"],"es":["Construir interfaces conversacionales con componentes de conversación preconstruidos","Optimizar el desarrollo de la interfaz de usuario de los mensajes con componentes de mensajes personalizables","Acelerar el desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de IA con la biblioteca de componentes de AI Elements"],"fr":["Construire des interfaces conversationnelles avec des composants de conversation préconstruits","Optimiser le développement de l''interface utilisateur des messages avec des composants de messages personnalisables","Accélérer le développement d''applications natives IA avec la bibliothèque de composants d''AI Elements"],"de":["Konversationsinterfaces mit vorgefertigten Konversationskomponenten erstellen","Die Entwicklung der Benutzeroberfläche von Nachrichten mit anpassbaren Nachrichtenkomponenten optimieren","Die Entwicklung von AI-nativen Anwendungen mit der Komponentenbibliothek von AI Elements beschleunigen"],"pt":["Construção de interfaces de conversação com componentes de conversação pré-construídos","Otimização do desenvolvimento de UI de mensagens com componentes de mensagens personalizáveis","Aceleração do desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de IA com biblioteca de componentes de Elementos de IA"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов для разговора с предварительно построенными компонентами разговора","Оптимизация разработки UI для сообщений с настраиваемыми компонентами сообщений","Ускорение разработки приложений, родных для ИИ, с помощью библиотеки компонентов Элементов ИИ"],"ar":["بناء واجهات محادثة مع مكونات محادثة مبنية مسبقًا","تحسين تطوير واجهة المستخدم للرسائل مع مكونات رسائل قابلة للتعديل","تسريع تطوير تطبيقات ذكية الأصل باستخدام مكتبة مكونات العناصر الذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui library integration","Dependent on AI Elements package installation via npm or dedicated CLI"],"zh":["需要集成 shadcn/ui 库","依赖于 AI Elements 包的安装，通过 npm 或专用 CLI"],"ja":["shadcn/ui ライブラリの統合が必要","AI Elements パッケージのインストールに依存しており、npm または専用の CLI を介してインストールする必要がある"],"ko":["shadcn/ui 라이브러리의 통합이 필요","AI Elements 패키지의 설치에 의존하며, npm 또는 전용 CLI를 통해 설치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la biblioteca shadcn/ui","Depende de la instalación del paquete AI Elements a través de npm o la CLI dedicada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque shadcn/ui","Dépend de l''installation du paquet AI Elements via npm ou la ligne de commande dédiée"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der shadcn/ui-Bibliothek","Hängt von der Installation des AI-Elements-Pakets über npm oder der dedizierten CLI ab"],"pt":["Exige integração com a biblioteca shadcn/ui","Dependente da instalação do pacote de Elementos de IA via npm ou CLI dedicada"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой shadcn/ui","Зависит от установки пакета Элементов ИИ через npm или посвященную CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع المكتبة shadcn/ui","يعتمد على تثبيت حزمة العناصر الذكية عبر npm أو CLI مخصصة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6e1697f6728f131cfbbb6b53543438921ce11faafcc4d5e0cc361b1643324e71","qualityScore":54}');
