 vidéos","IA pour l''immobilier"],"de":["firecrawl-scraper","Video-Produktionstools","Luxus-Immobilienmakler","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1","Eigenschaftsextraktion","Videogenerierung","KI für Immobilien"],"pt":["Firecrawl Scraper","extração de dados de imóveis","geração de vídeo automática","IA para imóveis","ferramentas de desenvolvimento para imóveis","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1","desenvolvedores de imóveis"],"ru":["Firecrawl Scraper","извлечение данных о недвижимости","автоматическая генерация видео","ИИ для недвижимости","инструменты для разработчиков недвижимости","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1","разработчики недвижимости"],"ar":["Firecrawl Scraper","استخراج بيانات العقارات","التحويل التلقائي إلى فيديو","الذكاء الاصطناعي للعقارات","أدوات تطوير العقارات","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1","مطوري العقارات"]}},"owner":"Bobby44-max","repo":"boston-luxury-re-producer","repoPath":"Bobby44-max/boston-luxury-re-producer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.302Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"firecrawl-scraper","description":"Extract property data from real estate listing URLs using Firecrawl AI. Use when scraping Zillow, Redfin, Realtor.com, or any property listing site. Returns structured data ready for video generation.","bodyPreview":"# Firecrawl Property Extraction\n\n## Overview\nFirecrawl transforms any real estate listing URL into structured JSON data for video generation. It handles JavaScript rendering, anti-bot measures, and image extraction automatically.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport Firecrawl from ''@mendable/firecrawl-js'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n  apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\n});\n\nconst result = await firecrawl.extract({\n  urls: [listingUrl],\n  prompt: ''Extract prop","body":"# Firecrawl Property Extraction\n\n## Overview\nFirecrawl transforms any real estate listing URL into structured JSON data for video generation. It handles JavaScript rendering, anti-bot measures, and image extraction automatically.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport Firecrawl from ''@mendable/firecrawl-js'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n  apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\n});\n\nconst result = await firecrawl.extract({\n  urls: [listingUrl],\n  prompt: ''Extract property details for video generation'',\n  schema: PropertySchema\n});\n```\n\n## Supported Sites\n\n| Site | URL Pattern | Data Quality |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| Zillow | zillow.com/homedetails/* | Excellent |\n| Redfin | redfin.com/*/home/* | Excellent |\n| Realtor.com | realtor.com/realestateandhomes-detail/* | Excellent |\n| Trulia | trulia.com/home/* | Good |\n| Homes.com | homes.com/property/* | Good |\n| MLS Sites | Varies by region | Good |\n| Broker Sites | Any | Variable |\n\n## Property Schema\n\nSee [rules/property-extraction.md](rules/property-extraction.md) for complete schema.\n\n```typescript\nconst PropertySchema = z.object({\n  address: z.string(),\n  city: z.string(),\n  state: z.string(),\n  zipCode: z.string(),\n  price: z.number(),\n  bedrooms: z.number(),\n  bathrooms: z.number(),\n  sqft: z.number(),\n  lotSize: z.string().optional(),\n  yearBuilt: z.number().optional(),\n  propertyType: z.string(),\n  description: z.string(),\n  features: z.array(z.string()),\n  images: z.array(z.string()),\n  agent: z.object({\n    name: z.string(),\n    phone: z.string().optional(),\n    brokerage: z.string().optional(),\n  }).optional(),\n});\n```\n\n## Advanced Extraction\n\n### Competitor Analysis\n```typescript\nconst CompetitorSchema = z.object({\n  listings: z.array(z.object({\n    address: z.string(),\n    price: z.number(),\n    daysOnMarket: z.number(),\n    pricePerSqft: z.number(),\n  })),\n  marketTrends: z.object({\n    medianPrice: z.number(),\n    averageDaysOnMarket: z.number(),\n    inventoryCount: z.number(),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Market Data\nSee [rules/market-data.md](rules/market-data.md)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Rate Limiting**: Max 10 requests/minute on standard plan\n2. **Error Handling**: Always wrap in try/catch\n3. **Image Quality**: Request high-res images when available\n4. **Caching**: Cache results for 24 hours to save credits\n5. **Validation**: Always validate extracted data with Zod\n\n## API Integration\n\n### Next.js Route Handler\n```typescript\n// /app/api/scrape/route.ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { url } = await request.json();\n\n  const firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n    apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY!\n  });\n\n  const result = await firecrawl.extract({\n    urls: [url],\n    prompt: ''Extract property listing data'',\n    schema: PropertySchema,\n  });\n\n  return Response.json({\n    success: true,\n    data: result.data\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Credit Usage\n\n| Operation | Credits |\n|-----------|---------|\n| /scrape (single page) | 1 |\n| /crawl (per page) | 1 |\n| /extract (AI) | Tokens-based |\n| /map (URL discovery) | 1 per 100 URLs |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  const result = await firecrawl.extract({ ... });\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error.statusCode === 429) {\n    // Rate limited - wait and retry\n  } else if (error.statusCode === 403) {\n    // Site blocked - try alternative approach\n  } else {\n    // Log and return fallback\n  }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:44.556Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real Estate Agents needing automated property data extraction and video generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化房产数据提取和视频生成能力的房地产经纪人。","ja":"不動産エージェントが自動化された物件データ抽出および動画生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 부동산 데이터 추출 및 비디오 생성 기능이 필요한 부동산 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes inmobiliarios que necesitan capacidades de extracción automática de datos de propiedades y generación de video.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents immobiliers ayant besoin de capacités d''extraction automatique de données de propriétés et de génération de vidéos.","de":"Perfekt für Immobilienmakler, die automatisierte Eigentumsdatenextraktions- und Videogenerierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Corretor de Imóveis que precisam de extração automática de dados de propriedades e capacidades de geração de vídeo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по недвижимости, которым необходима автоматизированная экстракция данных объектов недвижимости и возможности генерации видео.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل العقارية التي تحتاج إلى استخراج بيانات ملكية автомاتيكي وقدرات توليد الفيديو."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform real estate listing URLs into structured JSON data, handling JavaScript rendering and anti-bot measures using the Firecrawl API, and supports image extraction for video generation.","zh":"赋予代理人将房地产列表URL转换为结构化JSON数据的能力，使用Firecrawl API处理JavaScript渲染和反爬措施，并支持图像提取以生成视频。","ja":"Firecrawl APIを使用してJavaScriptのレンダリングとボット対策を処理し、画像の抽出をサポートしてビデオを生成することで、不動産リストのURLを構造化されたJSONデータに変換する機能をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"Firecrawl API를 사용하여 자바스크립트 렌더링 및 보안조치를 처리하고 이미지 추출을 지원하여 비디오를 생성함으로써 부동산 목록 URL을 구조화된 JSON 데이터로 변환하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar las URL de las listas de bienes raíces en datos JSON estructurados, maneja el renderizado de JavaScript y las medidas anti-bot utilizando la Firecrawl API, y admite la extracción de imágenes para la generación de video.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les URL des listes de biens immobiliers en données JSON structurées, gère le rendu JavaScript et les mesures anti-robot à l''aide de la Firecrawl API, et prend en charge l''extraction d''images pour la génération de vidéos.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Immobilienangebots-URLs in strukturierte JSON-Daten umzuwandeln, JavaScript-Rendering und Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen mit der Firecrawl API zu verarbeiten und unterstützt die Bildextraktion für die Videogenerierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar URLs de listas de imóveis em dados JSON estruturados, lidando com renderização JavaScript e medidas anti-bot usando a Firecrawl API, e suporta extração de imagens para geração de vídeo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать URL-адреса списков недвижимости в структурированные данные JSON, обрабатывая рендеринг JavaScript и меры против роботов с помощью Firecrawl API, и поддерживает извлечение изображений для генерации видео.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحويل عناوين URL لقوائم العقارات إلى بيانات JSON منظمة، ويعامل مع تقديم JavaScript وضد إجراءات الروبوت باستخدام Firecrawl API، ودعم استخراج الصور لتوليد الفيديو."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting property details from real estate listing URLs","Generating video content for luxury real estate agents","Automating data collection for market analysis"],"zh":["从房地产列表URL中提取房产详细信息","为豪华房地产经纪人生成视频内容","自动化市场分析的数据收集"],"ja":["不動産リストのURLから物件の詳細情報を抽出する","豪華不動産エージェントのための動画コンテンツの生成","市場分析のためのデータ収集の自動化"],"ko":["부동산 목록 URL에서 부동산 상세 정보를 추출하는 것","고급 부동산 에이전트를 위한 비디오 콘텐츠 생성","시장 분석을 위한 데이터 수집 자동화"],"es":["Extracción de detalles de propiedades de las URL de las listas de bienes raíces","Generación de contenido de video para agentes inmobiliarios de lujo","Automatización de la recopilación de datos para el análisis de mercado"],"fr":["Extraction de détails de propriétés à partir des URL des listes de biens immobiliers","Génération de contenu vidéo pour les agents immobiliers de luxe","Automatisation de la collecte de données pour l''analyse de marché"],"de":["Extraktion von Eigentumsdetails aus Immobilienangebots-URLs","Generierung von Videoinhalten für Luxus-Immobilienmakler","Automatisierung der Datenerfassung für Marktanalyse"],"pt":["Extração de detalhes de propriedades de URLs de listas de imóveis","Geração de conteúdo de vídeo para agentes de luxo imobiliário","Automatização da coleta de dados para análise de mercado"],"ru":["Извлечение деталей объектов недвижимости из URL-адресов списков недвижимости","Генерация видеоконтента для агентов по роскошной недвижимости","Автоматизация сбора данных для анализа рынка"],"ar":["استخراج تفاصيل العقارات من عناوين URL لقوائم العقارات","توليد محتوى الفيديو لوسائل العقارية الفاخرة","أتمتة جمع البيانات لتحليل السوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firecrawl API Key","Handles JavaScript rendering and anti-bot measures but may have limitations with complex web pages"],"zh":["需要Firecrawl API密钥","可以处理JavaScript渲染和反爬措施，但可能对复杂的网页有所限制"],"ja":["Firecrawl APIキーが必要","JavaScriptのレンダリングとボット対策を処理できますが、複雑なWebページでは制限がある可能性があります"],"ko":["Firecrawl API 키가 필요합니다.","자바스크립트 렌더링 및 보안조치를 처리할 수 있지만 복잡한 웹 페이지에서는 제한이 있을 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Firecrawl","Maneja el renderizado de JavaScript y las medidas anti-bot, pero puede tener limitaciones con páginas web complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Firecrawl","Gère le rendu JavaScript et les mesures anti-robot, mais peut avoir des limites avec les pages Web complexes"],"de":["Benötigt einen Firecrawl-API-Schlüssel","Verarbeitet JavaScript-Rendering und Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen, kann aber Einschränkungen bei komplexen Webseiten haben"],"pt":["Exige Chave de API Firecrawl","Lida com renderização JavaScript e medidas anti-bot, mas pode ter limitações com páginas web complexas"],"ru":["Требует ключа API Firecrawl","Обрабатывает рендеринг JavaScript и меры против роботов, но может иметь ограничения с сложными веб-страницами"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API Firecrawl","يتعامل مع تقديم JavaScript وضد إجراءات الروبوت، ولكنه قد يكون له قيود مع صفحات الويب المعقدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8b2a43989e56a4110078e2f82fea8be743d3bfede6ef3014bd09940860f4349d","qualityScore":54}');
