INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('TypedDevs/bashunit/add-assertion', 'add-assertion', 'TypedDevs', 'bashunit', 'community', 'add-assertion TypedDevs bashunit community The add-assertion skill provides a simple testing library for bash scripts, benefiting developers who need to add new assertions to their framework. Add Assertion Skill是一个简单却强大的测试库，用于bash脚本，遵循严格的TDD方法ology Add Assertion Skillは、bashスクリプト用のシンプルながら強力なテストライブラリです Add Assertion Skill은 bash 스크립트를 위한 간단하지만 강력한 테스트 라이브러리입니다 Add-assertion es una biblioteca de testing simple pero poderosa para scripts bash que sigue la metodología TDD estricta Add-assertion est une bibliothèque de testing simple mais puissante pour les scripts bash qui suit la méthodologie TDD stricte Add-assertion ist eine einfache, aber leistungsstarke Testbibliothek für bash-Skripte, die die TDD-Methodik streng einhält O add-assertion é uma biblioteca de teste simples, mas poderosa, para scripts bash. Add-assertion - это простая, но мощная библиотека для тестирования bash скриптов. أداة Add-Assertion هي مكتبة اختبار بسيطة ولكن قوية للبرامج النصية Bash. how to use add-assertion add-assertion alternative add-assertion setup guide what is add-assertion add-assertion vs bashunit add-assertion install TDD testing library for bash scripts bash script testing framework Add Assertion Skill AIエージェント测试库 bashunit TDD方法ology 测试库 bash脚本测试 断言函数添加 测试库标准 Invokes /add-assertion command for adding new assertions to the framework Requires task file creation in .tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-add-assertion-name.md format Studies tests/unit/assert_test.sh for understanding patterns Enhances existing assertion capabilities with new assert_* functions Follows strict TDD methodology for reliable testing add-assertion is a testing library for bash scripts that allows developers to add new assertion functions following strict Test-Driven Development (TDD) methodology.');
